    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Opportunity to acquire a three bedroom semi-detached residence situated on Convent Road, Claremorris. The property is ideally located close to Claremorris town Centre and all the amenties it has to offer. The property was built in the 1930' s and extends to 1,319 sq.ft.\r\n\r\nSome of the features of the property include tiled flooring in entrance hallway, sitting room with timber flooing & fireplace, tiled bathroom, utility room plumbed for washing machine, oil fired central heating, 3 bedrooms, sinks with vanity units in all bedrooms, white double glazed PVC windows throughout and rear yard with ample parking. Externally here is a large detached garage. \r\n\r\nThis property requires some renovation internals.\r\n\r\nThe accomadation comprises of Entrance Hallway, TV Room, Kitchen, Dining/Living Room, Utility Room, 3 Bedrooms, Guest WC and Main Bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 7.0m x 1.8m \r\nWith tiled flooring, coving to ceiling, 1 radiator and 1 phone point.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 3.93m x 3.43m \r\nWith timber flooring, cast iron fireplace with timber surround and 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nDining Room - 3.76m x 2.74m \r\nTimber flooring, 1 radiator\r\n\r\nTV Room - 3.54m x 3.18m \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.56m x 3.54m \r\nTo be completed\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 3.7m x 1.33m \r\nWith 3 double sockets and plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nGuest WC - 3.7m x 2.54m \r\nWith 1 radiator, wheelchair accessible shower unit with Mira Elite Electric shower, toilet and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nLanding - 6.76m x 0.71m \r\nWith carpeted flooring and full length windows.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.84m x 2.97m \r\nWith carpeted flooring, 1 double socket, 1 radiator and 1 sink with vanity unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.92m x 3.44m \r\nWith carpeted flooring, 1 double socket, 1 radiator and sink with vanity unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.45m x 3.18m \r\nWith linoleum flooring, 1 radiator, sink with vanity unit and 1 double socket.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.15m x 2.39m \r\nWith tiled flooring, wall semi-tiled, bath, toilet, wash hand basin, shower with Mira Elite 2 Electric Shower and 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nGarage - 6.13m x 3.39m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Three bedroom semi-detached residence.\r\nIdeally located close to Claremorris town centre and all amenties it has to offer.\r\nExtends to c. 1,319 sq.ft.\r\nTiled flooring in entrance hallway.\r\nTiled bathroom.\r\nUtility room plumbed for washing machine.\r\nWhite double glazed PVC windows and doors.\r\nRear yard with ample parking.\r\nLarge detached garage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Claremorris take the Castlebar Road. Drive down this road just past Duggans Garage and the property is on your left hand side. Look out for the DNG Gilligan sign. F12 W268"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "By appointment only."
      }
